  message: "Lead from INV-hotib's fix (PR #2042, 2026-11-03): the live repro of the guard gap is dev acf67df4cb (verify-claims withholds on 3 modules, check-claims-coverage rc 0; logs in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/self_audit_11032026/: self_claims.json, claims_coverage.log). Bisect: at 1443c2da57 (before #2036) the full run already withheld on hypergumbo_core.scip._generated.scip_pb2 alone, so the guard missed a generated-output 'untraced dependency source' slot independently of #2036; #2036 (3e4b895996, a chain rooted at a from-imported name keeps its module slot) then added textual.widgets.Select and datetime.timezone, which the guard also missed. Two shapes to explain, possibly one cause: how the guard's analyzer-only pipeline (find_files + FileIndex over the packaging roots, no generated-output roots?) classifies _generated/ versus the full run's ADR-0004 exclusion, and whether the from-imported chain slots reach the guard's edge set at all. Reproduce in a worktree at acf67df4cb; the three grants in #2042 mean dev itself no longer shows it."  # 5c31
